					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Hey all! I know a lot of you have been wanting to have a guild raid..well this is it..Saturday March 9, 2002 There will be a guild raid at the arena for ALL levels!  You will be paired up in groups to fight each other....There is NO looting other corpses...This is just for fun!  I am hoping to see more of you there then the Lake of Ill Omen raid last Saturday...Remember there will be NO looting people...This raid will start at 12:00pm MST (that's 11:00am PST, 1:00p CST, and 2:00p EST)  I am sure it will be a blast...and who knows maybe your gonna get a chance to get me hehe =0)~.  Please be at the Arena by 11:30a MST (10:30a PST, 12:30p CST, and 1:30p EST).  I hope to see you all there. And as always you can drop me a tell on Wanuvwenya or e-mail me at Wanuvwenya@aol.com.  Thanks all and be safe! Hope to see you there! =0)~<br />
Wanuvwenya
